      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Suppose we want to measure the volume of a fish tank. What units could we use?",
      "worked_solution": "We can measure length in inches $(\\text{in}).$ When measuring lengths in inches, volumes are measured in $\\text{in}\\times \\text{in}\\times \\text{in},$ which is usually written as ${\\text{in}}^{3}.$",
